{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 50, :comments ["<b>הפקד</b> Twice in the Masorah: here and the other <b>הפקד</b> — \"appoint a wicked man over him.\" This is what they said: A man is not appointed as an officer below unless he has been made a wicked man above. And this is <b>הפקד את הלוים</b>, who were appointed as officers — <b>הפקד עליו רשע</b>."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:21:01.038224986Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}